N5008 [temp.inst]/8 + /11: an unused, non-virtual, ill-formed-when-instantiated
inline member must not cause an error.  Guards the lazy-instantiation property
during the Option B (on-odr-use member instantiation) pivot.  See
doc/architectural/cpp-extern-template-member-instantiation.md.
